public import Mathlib.Data.Fin.VecNotation

/-!
# Pairs of disjoint triples on eight letters

This is the lexicographic list of unordered pairs of disjoint three-element
subsets of `Fin 8`. A pair specifies the supports of two independent
three-cycles. This module supplies only the concrete data; completeness as
a list of Sylow three-subgroups requires a separate conjugacy proof.

Source application: Aschbacher–Smith, proof of 1.3.4, printed p.511,
and the octad stabilizer `E₁₆.A₈` in GLS3, Table 5.3e.
The reproducible, untrusted generator is `source/generate_triples.py`.
-/

@[expose] public section
namespace Sporadic.Mathieu.M24LocalGeometry.PairOvergroups.Placement.EightPoint

